WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:23.900
[Music]

00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:31.480
[Narrator:] Bird's-eye view of a typical rapid treatment center in a southern state,

00:00:31.489 --> 00:00:35.489
located in a former CCC camp, as are many of these hospitals. 

00:00:35.820 --> 00:00:41.180
Newly infected women are treated with a new intensive therapy for syphilis and gonorrhea.

00:00:42.280 --> 00:00:47.620
The fact that these centers are not jails
based on human restraints, but really hospitals

00:00:47.620 --> 00:00:50.940
is reflected in the faces of these girls:

00:00:51.460 --> 00:00:59.560
young, old, city girls, farm girls, good, bad, average girls.

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:10.660
[Music]

00:01:13.560 --> 00:01:19.520
But, there are other places where infected
women are taken. This is a jail, a small country jail.

00:01:19.920 --> 00:01:25.040
And then the city prison in which such
women are detained is even more squalid and filthy.

00:01:29.770 --> 00:01:34.070
At the rapid treatment center, the arrival
of a group of girls is the beginning of a

00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:38.620
carefully planned schedule of several weeks duration. 

00:01:38.780 --> 00:01:45.359
The girls are taken directly to the hospital's reception center.

00:01:45.359 --> 00:01:51.399
Let's follow a typical new patient. We'll
call her Mary Lou. 

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:57.980
That's Mary Lou there with the rumpled dress and package under arm.

00:01:58.840 --> 00:02:04.840
Like all the others, Mary Lou is interviewed
by a receptionist who tries to make her feel at home.

00:02:04.900 --> 00:02:10.010
A patient, one of the hospital's clerical helpers, types her name and address upon a record.

00:02:14.480 --> 00:02:19.200
This girl not many weeks ago was a new patient like Mary Lou.

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:33.700
As soon as possible after the patient's arrival, the doctor performs a complete physical examination.

00:02:33.940 --> 00:02:45.299
[Music]

00:02:45.299 --> 00:02:50.959
Taking a specimen for a smear.

00:02:50.959 --> 00:02:57.739
[Music]

00:02:57.740 --> 00:03:02.540
Mary Lou gets her smallpox vaccination, receives
typhoid inoculations. 

00:03:02.840 --> 00:03:08.520
Other public health precautions are also taken.

00:03:08.520 --> 00:03:12.740
[Music]

00:03:12.940 --> 00:03:17.640
Several days of bed rest are required of Mary
Lou and all other new girls. 

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:24.380
During this time, treatment is begun for some like Mary Lou who have gonorrhea. 

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:32.520
To make sure that Mary Lou has the prescribed course of sulfathiazol,
the barracks matron stands by.

00:03:37.160 --> 00:03:44.280
Soon after arrival, a nurse interviews the
patient. 

00:03:44.860 --> 00:03:50.840
When she learns why it is important, Mary Lou reveals the names of her contacts.

00:03:55.360 --> 00:04:02.780
Syphilis therapy, the ten-week schedule of treatment, is one method used here.

00:04:05.180 --> 00:04:09.000
The five- day intravenous drip is also employed.

00:04:16.840 --> 00:04:18.920
The doctor keeps a careful check. 

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:27.280
At this center, the physician holds a consultation with each girl once a week.

00:04:28.480 --> 00:04:32.500
Most of the girls are able to work during
the greater part of their stay.

00:04:32.700 --> 00:04:39.040
They are given the choice of a dozen or more activities and are paid for their work. 

00:04:39.220 --> 00:04:45.020
Their earnings are saved to be given them upon discharge.

00:04:48.160 --> 00:04:52.640
These girls displayed natural aptitude for
hospital duties.

00:04:57.820 --> 00:05:05.480
Another type of work...as kitchen assistants,
patients may be assigned to aid the chef.

00:05:08.680 --> 00:05:12.720
Here all the clothes, bed linens, and other
things used by the center 

00:05:13.020 --> 00:05:15.700
are turned out by the sewing room trainees. 

00:05:16.020 --> 00:05:20.740
Under supervision of the instructor, they develop latent skills.

00:05:29.220 --> 00:05:36.220
Among the more popular training courses is
the beauty parlor class.

00:05:39.380 --> 00:05:42.680
An airplane sheet metal work class at a vocational
school. 

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:49.580
Rapid treatment centers are doing their best to provide such opportunities for rehabilitation.

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:56.960
Welding offers another opportunity for timely and patriotic service.

00:05:56.960 --> 00:06:06.960
[Music]

00:06:06.960 --> 00:06:14.420
For those who have never learned to read and
write, there is primary instruction too.

00:06:19.180 --> 00:06:21.420
Mail call.

00:06:25.220 --> 00:06:28.720
Letters from home. 

00:06:30.580 --> 00:06:33.440
This girl got a letter
from her husband.

00:06:37.300 --> 00:06:38.840
Weekly show night.

00:06:39.020 --> 00:06:44.640
An entire performance organized
and directed by the girls who also made the costumes.

00:06:47.400 --> 00:06:52.920
[Music]

00:06:52.920 --> 00:07:03.800
[Inaudible singing]

00:07:08.160 --> 00:07:22.120
[Music]

00:07:23.140 --> 00:07:28.140
Negro patients enjoy dancing, and how!

00:07:28.620 --> 00:07:40.920
[Music]

00:07:43.440 --> 00:07:47.120
Each evening everybody marches to the foot of the flagstaff, 

00:07:47.340 --> 00:07:52.100
there to join in a solemn and patriotic ceremonial.

00:07:55.620 --> 00:08:00.880
All eyes on the colors.

00:08:02.960 --> 00:08:21.500
[A bugle plays.]

00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:30.120
In due time the doctor tells Mary Lou that
she is well again and will be discharged.

00:08:36.560 --> 00:08:40.640
He has more good news, too.

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:48.900
A letter from an aircraft company offering
a job.

00:08:52.880 --> 00:08:57.620
And Mary Lou is really feeling good now.

00:09:01.230 --> 00:09:08.230
A new dress purchased out of her earnings
while at the center.

00:09:11.680 --> 00:09:16.860
A staff member has already secured her ticket to the city where she will work.

00:09:22.600 --> 00:09:28.600
And so it's goodbye to Mary Lou.

00:09:30.200 --> 00:09:36.620
And now she has a real job paying a decent living wage, and a new life lands before her,

00:09:36.819 --> 00:09:40.419
thanks to the rapid treatment center.

00:09:40.420 --> 00:09:43.940
[Music]

00:09:44.100 --> 00:09:47.440
[The End]

